<div style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(245, 231, 214); border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px; display: grid; gap: 14px; align-content: start;">
<div style="display: grid; gap: 5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(244, 234, 219); padding-bottom: 14px;">
<span style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: rgb(26, 18, 6);">Free gift</span>
